{
  "_about": [
    "重構前錄下的 API contract 快照（Stage 0 安全網）。",
    "每個 stage 完成後執行 `npm run contract` 比對，確保 request/response 形狀沒有改變。",
    "shape 語法：",
    "  \"string\" / \"number\" / \"boolean\" / \"null\" / \"object\" / \"array\" / \"any\"，可用 | 組成聯集",
    "  [shape]        → 陣列，每個元素都要符合 shape",
    "  { \"k\": shape } → 物件；key 結尾加 ? 表示可選；key \"*\" 表示其餘所有值都要符合",
    "expectStatus   → 只有這些狀態碼算成功；其餘即使形狀符合也視為失敗。",
    "requireNonEmpty → 成功時這些路徑必須「至少有一個非空值」，用來擋掉",
    "                  「形狀對但資料全空」的假綠燈。`[*]` 表示展開陣列。"
  ],
  "baseUrl": "http://localhost:3000",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "id": "import-google-maps",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/import/google-maps",
      "calledBy": "（目前無前端呼叫）",
      "writesDatabase": false,
      "callsExternalApi": "Nominatim / Google Maps",
      "request": { "raw_input": "駁二藝術特區" },
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "requireNonEmpty": ["$.parsed_pois"],
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "parsed_pois": [
            {
              "poi_name": "string",
              "lat": "number",
              "lng": "number",
              "matched": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "400": { "error": "string" },
        "500": { "error": "string" }
      },
      "notes": [
        "查無結果時仍回 200 且 parsed_pois 為空陣列 —— 但那代表 geocoding 壞了，",
        "所以 requireNonEmpty 會把它判為失敗（Nominatim 被限流時也會紅，屬預期行為）。",
        "matched 目前永遠是 true（L2）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parking-live",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/parking/live",
      "calledBy": "components/TripParkingModal.tsx",
      "writesDatabase": false,
      "callsExternalApi": "TDX",
      "request": { "parkingIds": ["KHA00001", "KHA00002", "KHA00003"] },
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "requireNonEmpty": ["$.availabilities"],
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "availabilities": { "*": "number|null" },
          "updated_at?": "string"
        },
        "400": {
          "error": "string",
          "availabilities": "object"
        },
        "500": {
          "error": "string",
          "availabilities": "object"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "parkingIds 使用 parking_lots_cache 中 has_dynamic_data = true 的真實 ID",
        "（KHA00001~3 確實存在於 TDX 即時車位 feed 中）。",
        "Stage 2 已修正 OData filter：ParkingID → CarParkID，這個 endpoint 現在真的會回資料，",
        "所以重新啟用 requireNonEmpty，避免 wildcard 形狀又變成沒被驗證過。",
        "⚠ TDX 每分鐘只允許 5 次請求。若短時間內重複執行 contract，這一條會因為 429 而",
        "   回 200 + 空 availabilities，進而被 requireNonEmpty 判為 FAIL —— 那是額度問題，",
        "   等一分鐘再跑即可。",
        "TDX 對「無即時資料」的停車場會回 AvailableSpaces = -1，後端原樣傳遞不改寫語意，",
        "   所以值域是 number|null 且可能為負數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parking-live-empty",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/parking/live",
      "calledBy": "components/TripParkingModal.tsx",
      "writesDatabase": false,
      "callsExternalApi": "無（提前 return）",
      "request": { "parkingIds": [] },
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "responses": {
        "200": { "availabilities": "object" }
      },
      "notes": [
        "空輸入的提前 return 路徑，不會呼叫 TDX。",
        "這一條刻意不設 requireNonEmpty —— 空的 availabilities 就是正確結果。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trip-generate",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/trip/generate",
      "calledBy": "（目前無前端呼叫）",
      "writesDatabase": true,
      "callsExternalApi": "Gemini",
      "request": {
        "prompt": "輕鬆高雄一日遊",
        "poi_list": [
          { "poi_name": "駁二藝術特區", "lat": 22.6201, "lng": 120.2818 },
          { "poi_name": "高雄流行音樂中心", "lat": 22.6133, "lng": 120.2925 }
        ]
      },
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "requireNonEmpty": ["$.nodes"],
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "trip_id": "string",
          "title": "string",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "sequence_order": "number",
              "node_type": "string",
              "poi_name": "string",
              "stay_duration_minutes": "number",
              "lat": "number",
              "lng": "number",
              "summary": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "400": { "error": "string" },
        "500": { "error": "string" }
      },
      "notes": [
        "⚠ 會寫入 trips 與 trip_nodes，預設不執行（需加 --include-writes）。",
        "trips.trip_id 是 uuid，node-pg 以字串回傳。",
        "nodes 直接回傳 lib/aiPlanner.ts 的 structured output，欄位由 responseSchema 的 required 保證。",
        "500 目前直接回傳 error.message（H3，待後續 stage 修正）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trip-ai-plan-with-parking",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/trip/ai-plan-with-parking",
      "calledBy": "app/page.tsx",
      "writesDatabase": false,
      "callsExternalApi": "Gemini + TDX",
      "request": {
        "places": [
          { "name": "駁二藝術特區", "lat": 22.6201, "lng": 120.2818 },
          { "name": "高雄流行音樂中心", "lat": 22.6133, "lng": 120.2925 },
          { "name": "旗津天后宮", "lat": 22.6137, "lng": 120.2678 }
        ]
      },
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "requireNonEmpty": ["$.schedule", "$.schedule[*].candidate_parkings"],
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "success": "boolean",
          "itinerary_flow": "string",
          "schedule": [
            {
              "spot_order": "number|string",
              "spot_name": "string",
              "lat": "number|string",
              "lng": "number|string",
              "suggested_stay_minutes?": "number|string",
              "reason?": "string",
              "walk_minutes_to_spot": "number|null",
              "source": "string",
              "confidence": "number",
              "candidate_parkings": [
                {
                  "parking_id": "string",
                  "name": "string",
                  "lat": "number",
                  "lng": "number",
                  "total_spaces": "number|string|null",
                  "available_spaces": "number|string|null",
                  "distance_meters": "number",
                  "distance_display": "string",
                  "hourly_rate": "string",
                  "fare_description": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "400": { "error": "string" },
        "500": { "error": "string" }
      },
      "notes": [
        "spot_order / spot_name / lat / lng / suggested_stay_minutes / reason 全部是 Gemini 的",
        "原始輸出，這個 route 沒有 responseSchema 也沒有驗證（H1），所以數值欄位一律",
        "接受 number|string，避免模型偶爾回字串就誤報。等 zod 進來後再收緊。",
        "單一景點的 candidate_parkings 可能為空（1.5km 內真的沒停車場），",
        "所以 requireNonEmpty 用 [*] 語意：只要有一個景點找得到停車場就算過。",
        "M9（additive）：新增 walk_minutes_to_spot / source / confidence 三個欄位。",
        "   walk_minutes_to_spot 由最近候選停車場的距離換算，與 distance_display 共用同一個計算函式；",
        "   該景點 1.5km 內沒有停車場時為 null。",
        "   source 目前固定為 'user'（景點由呼叫端提供）；confidence 是【來源可信度】0~1，",
        "   source='user' → 1，代表 POI 由使用者明確提供而非模型推測 —— 不是 LLM 的信心分數。",
        "⚠ arrival_time / departure_time / parking_arrival_time 需要「出發時間 + 景點間車程」，",
        "   open_time / close_time 需要景點營業時間資料集 —— 目前系統都沒有這些來源，",
        "   因此刻意【不產生】這些欄位，不以推測值填充。",
        "⚠ 這一條會消耗 Gemini 額度。免費方案 gemini-2.5-flash 每天只有 20 次",
        "   （quotaId: GenerateRequestsPerDayPerProjectPerModel-FreeTier）。額度用完時",
        "   route 會回 500 {error:'規劃失敗', details:'...RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED...'}，",
        "   contract 會判為 FAIL —— 這是額度問題不是 contract 問題，看 details 即可分辨。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trip-insert-parking",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/trip/{tripId}/insert-parking",
      "calledBy": "（目前無前端呼叫）",
      "writesDatabase": true,
      "callsExternalApi": "TDX",
      "requiresEnv": "CONTRACT_TRIP_ID",
      "request": {},
      "expectStatus": [200],
      "requireNonEmpty": ["$.nodes"],
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "success": "boolean",
          "trip_id": "string",
          "total_nodes": "number",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "poi_name": "string",
              "lat": "number",
              "lng": "number",
              "node_type": "string",
              "sequence_order": "number",
              "node_id?": "number|string",
              "trip_id?": "string",
              "total_spaces?": "number|string|null",
              "available_spaces?": "number|string|null",
              "distance_meters?": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "400": { "error": "string" },
        "404": { "error": "string" },
        "500": { "error": "string" }
      },
      "notes": [
        "⚠ 會 DELETE 再重新 INSERT trip_nodes，預設不執行（需加 --include-writes）。",
        "⚠ 在 C1/C2 修好之前，重複執行會增生停車節點並清掉 stay_duration_minutes / summary，",
        "   請只對可拋棄的 trip 使用。",
        "expectStatus 刻意只留 200：若 CONTRACT_TRIP_ID 指到不存在或已清空的 trip，",
        "會回 404，那代表這次根本沒驗證到交易路徑，必須是紅燈而不是綠燈。",
        "nodes 陣列混了兩種形狀（停車場節點有 total_spaces/distance_meters 但沒有 node_id，",
        "景點節點相反，M4），這裡以「必要欄位 + 可選欄位」的聯集表示。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
